  "description": "A standalone, reflection-free, allocation-free JSON serializer: [JsonModel] source-generates idempotent readers and writers (UTF-16 and UTF-8) that implement ISpanFormattable / ISpanParsable, plus a zero-allocation JSON tape and a Newtonsoft-style DOM. No dependency on System.Text.Json.",
